 "doctype": "Print Format",
 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <title>Cargo Arrival Notice (Import)</title>\r\n    <style>\r\n        @page {\r\n            size: A4;\r\n            margin: 10mm;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            font-size: 11px;\r\n            color: #000;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .page {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            page-break-after: always;\r\n            box-sizing: border-box;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .page:last-child {\r\n            page-break-after: avoid;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Header */\r\n        .header {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\r\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .logo-section {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .logo-box {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 24px;\r\n            border: 2px solid #000;\r\n            padding: 2px 8px;\r\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .company-title {\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            line-height: 1.2;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .arabic-title {\r\n            font-size: 11px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            text-align: right;\r\n            direction: rtl;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Two Column Info Section */\r\n        .info-grid {\r\n            display: table;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .info-row {\r\n            display: table-row;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .info-col {\r\n            display: table-cell;\r\n            width: 50%;\r\n            vertical-align: top;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .info-box {\r\n            border: 1px solid #000;\r\n            padding: 6px;\r\n            min-height: 60px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .info-box-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            text-decoration: underline;\r\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Notification Title & Text */\r\n        .notification-header {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 13px;\r\n            margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\r\n            text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ref-line {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 11px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .notice-text {\r\n            text-align: justify;\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n            line-height: 1.3;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Tables */\r\n        .section-heading {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 11px;\r\n            text-decoration: underline;\r\n            margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        table.data-table {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            border-collapse: collapse;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        table.data-table th, \r\n        table.data-table td {\r\n            border: 1px solid #000;\r\n            padding: 4px 6px;\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n            vertical-align: top;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        table.data-table th {\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .text-right {\r\n            text-align: right;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .bold {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Notice Boxes */\r\n        .disclaimer-box {\r\n            font-size: 9px;\r\n            line-height: 1.2;\r\n            text-align: justify;\r\n            margin-top: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .arabic-text {\r\n            direction: rtl;\r\n            text-align: right;\r\n            font-size: 9.5px;\r\n            margin-top: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Signature Section */\r\n        .signature-container {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .signature-block {\r\n            width: 250px;\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .signature-space {\r\n            height: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* Footer */\r\n        .footer {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #000;\r\n            padding-top: 4px;\r\n            margin-top: 12px;\r\n            font-size: 8.5px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            line-height: 1.3;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .footer-gen {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            font-size: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 3px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PAGE 1 -->\r\n    <div class=\"page\">\r\n        <!-- Header -->\r\n        <div class=\"header\">\r\n            \r\n                <div class=\"company-title\">\r\n                    {{letter_head}}\r\n                </div>\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Date & Header Details -->\r\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>Job Ref.:</strong> {{ doc.name }}\r\n            </div>\r\n        \r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>NOTIFICATION</strong>\r\n            </div>\r\n        \r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>DATE:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.today() }}\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Consignee / Notify Party Grid -->\r\n        <div class=\"info-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-row\">\r\n                <div class=\"info-col\" style=\"padding-right: 4px;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"info-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"info-box-title\">Consignee</div>\r\n                        {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Party Table\",{\"party\":\"Consignee\",\"parent\":doc.name},\"name1\")}}<br>\r\n                        {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Party Table\",{\"party\":\"Consignee\",\"parent\":doc.name},\"address\")}}\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"info-col\" style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"info-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"info-box-title\">Notify Party</div>\r\n                        {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Party Table\",{\"party\":\"Consignee\",\"parent\":doc.name},\"name1\")}}<br>\r\n                        {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Party Table\",{\"party\":\"Notify1\",\"parent\":doc.name},\"address\")}}\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Notification Bar -->\r\n        <div class=\"ref-line\">\r\n            Ref: Vessel {{ doc.vessel }} Voyage No. {{ doc.voyage_no }}\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"notice-text\">\r\n            We are pleased to inform you the arrival of your consignment covered under below mentioned B/L and request you to kindly arrange prompt clearance of your cargo upon presentation of duly endorsed <b>ORIGINAL B/L</b>. In case cargo to be released against bank guarantee, kindly inform us in advance to obtain authorization from shipper through' port of loading Agent.\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Details of Cargo Table -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">DETAILS OF CARGO</div>\r\n        <table class=\"data-table\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"18%\"><b>Shipper (s)</b></td>\r\n                <td width=\"47%\">{{frappe.db.get_value(\"Party Table\",{\"party\":\"Shipper\",\"parent\":doc.name},\"name1\")}}</td>\r\n                <td width=\"15%\"><b>Arrival Date</b></td>\r\n                <td width=\"20%\">{{ doc.expected_routing[-1].eta }}</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><b>BL No</b></td>\r\n                <td>{{ doc.bl_no }}</td>\r\n                <td><b>B/L Type</b></td>\r\n                <td></td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><b>No. OF Packages</b></td>\r\n                <td>{{doc.no_of_packs}}</td>\r\n                <td><b>Weight</b></td>\r\n                <td>{{ doc.gross_weight_kg }}</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><b>Cargo..</b></td>\r\n                <td colspan=\"3\">\r\n                    {{ doc.desc_of_goods or ''}}\r\n                </td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><b>Container No(s).</b></td>\r\n                <td colspan=\"3\">{{ doc.table_tvep | map(attribute=\"container_no\") | join(\", \") }}</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n        </table>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Charges Table -->\r\n        <table class=\"data-table\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Description</th>\r\n                    <th width=\"20%\" class=\"text-right\">Amount (QAR)</th>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                {% for item in doc.contract_agreement %}\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>{{ item.item_name }}</td>\r\n                    <td class=\"text-right\">{{ item.line_total_amount }}</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                {% endfor %}\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td class=\"bold\">E&O.E &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; TOTAL</td>\r\n                    <td class=\"text-right bold\">{{ doc.grand_total+doc.total_liner }}</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Regulatory Notice -->\r\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-box\">\r\n            As per the DG acceptance regulation set by Hamad Port Authority, If the cargo imported falls under IMDG/Chemical category irrespective of their class or type of cargo, requires permission from terminal to discharge the DG container. The port approval is not obtained from Port Authority, no pre arrangement completed prior to the vessel Arrival, the Agents shall not be responsible if the cargo is not discharged from the vessel by Hamad Port Authority.\r\n            <br>\r\n            This document can be re-produce in Arabic language, upon request. Further should you wish to set Arabic as your preferred language for future standard notices, please contact our customer service.\r\n            <div class=\"arabic-text\">\r\n                \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646 \u062a\u0642\u062f\u064a\u0645 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0646\u062f \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u060c \u0648\u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0646\u0631\u062c\u0648\u0627 \u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0643\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0633\u0627\u0633\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u062c\u0645\u064a\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u062e\u0637\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u060c \u0644\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0644 \u0647\u0627\u062a\u0641 \u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0621 \u0631\u0642\u0645\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- Instructions & Terms -->\r\n        <div class=\"notice-text\" style=\"font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 15px;\">\r\n            <p >\r\n                Kindly note that we perform Custom clearance also as part of our service. If you require us to do customs clearance on your behalf, kindly submit all original documents at the earliest.\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                We request that the empty containers be returned to the line's stack in Clean & Sound condition with IMCO labels, if any, removed. Should there be any damage (internal/external) noticed, you are requested to forward us the photographs of the damaged part of the container including the container number portion. if damage is found to be due to cargo nature / shippers fault / consignee's fault then the repair cost need to be settled with us prior acceptance of MTY.\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                All payments must be made by \"ACCOUNT PAYEE\" Cheques in the name of <b>International Commercial and Shipping Services Company W.L.L</b>. Personnel cheques are not accepted.\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                As per company policy, as a guarantee of the safe return of the empty container, you are requested to deposit a guarantee cheque along with a Letter of Indemnity in the prescribed format (Stamped & signed by Authorized Signatory) while collecting the Delivery Order.\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Signature Block -->\r\n        <div class=\"signature-container\">\r\n            <div></div>\r\n            <div class=\"signature-block\">\r\n                For <b>International Commercial and Shipping Services Company W.L.L</b>\r\n                <div class=\"signature-space\"></div>\r\n                <b>{{ doc.owner }}</b>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <br>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Demurrage & DO Notes -->\r\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-box\" style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #000; padding-top: 10px;\">\r\n            <b>Note - 1</b> - Arrival notice is sent as an act of courtesy, the shipping line / or agent will not be responsible for any consequences in the event of non-receipt of the arrival notices and no claims will be entertained.\r\n            <br>\r\n            <b>LINE DEMURRAGE CHARGES SHALL BE APPLICABLE AFTER 7 DAYS FROM THE DATE OF ARRIVAL FOR STANDARD CONTAINERS (OR AS PER THE LINE'S TARIFF), 3 DAYS FOR TANK CONTAINERS AND SPECIAL CONTAINERS/EQUIPMENT (FLAT-RACK, OPENTOP, REEFER) AFTER ARRIVAL OF VESSEL.</b>\r\n            <br>\r\n            Please note that D.O will be released only after settlement of above mentioned charges and the Container Demurrage charges if any.\r\n            <br>\r\n            This document can be re-produce in Arabic language, upon request. Further should you wish to set Arabic as your preferred language for future standard notices, please contact our customer service.\r\n            <div class=\"arabic-text\">\r\n                \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646 \u062a\u0642\u062f\u064a\u0645 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0646\u062f \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u060c \u0648\u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0646\u0631\u062c\u0648\u0627 \u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0643\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0633\u0627\u0633\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u062c\u0645\u064a\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u062e\u0637\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u060c \u0644\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0644 \u0647\u0627\u062a\u0641 \u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0621 \u0631\u0642\u0645\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- Footer -->\r\n        <div class=\"footer\">\r\n            C.R.No: 23924 | PAID UP CAPITAL: QAR 3,000,000.00 | Bankers: CBQ Bank, QAR. A/C No. 4530-750008-001, US $ A/c No. 4530-750008-202 | P.O Box 12698, Doha-Qatar | Tel: (+974) 4470 2224 Fax: (+974) 4444 2385<br>\r\n            E-mail: icss@qatar.net.qa | Web: www.icssq.com<br>\r\n            Working Hours: Sunday - Thursday 7:30 AM TO 4:30 PM (Lunch Break 12:30 PM TO 1:30 PM) Saturday - 7:30 AM TO 1:30 PM\r\n            <div class=\"footer-gen\">\r\n                <span>Generated By {{ doc.owner }} On {{ doc.creation }}</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
